    {
      "id": "206",
      "type": "related_content",
      "attributes": {
        "id": 206,
        "relationship_type": "related",
        "body": "The particle まで has a core meaning of 'as far as' or 'to the extent of.' With verbs, it often means 'until A happens'—for example, 友達が来るまでテレビを見ていた ('I was watching TV until my friend came'). In other cases, it can mean 'even,' as in 骨まで食べた ('He even ate the bones'). Both uses reflect the core idea of reaching a certain extent or limit.",
        "first_relatable": {
          "id": 360,
          "slug": "v-まで",
